    FR  [4.1.REQ-5] The system shall store the information in the database.

[4.2] Account Login
    FR  [4.2.REQ-1] The system shall allow a registered user to log-in to their account.
    FR  [4.2.REQ-2] The system shall require a username and password from the user.
    FR  [4.2.REQ-3] The system will verify the username and password, and the user will be considered “logged-in”.

[4.3] Search
    FR  [4.3.REQ-1] The users can search for the book of their choice as well as a print shop.

