    FR  [4.5.REQ-3] After the user has indicated the particular book to be deleted from their shopping cart, the stored list representing the shopping cart should be updated by re…

[4.6] Rent
    FR  [4.6.REQ-1] The system shall allow a registered and logged-in user to rent-out books that are in their shopping cart.
    FR  [4.6.REQ-2] The system shall prompt the user to enter time period for renting out the books in the cart.
    FR  [4.6.REQ-3] The system shall display rent charged for the period of rental and individual rent of the books in the shopping cart.
    FR  [4.6.REQ-4] The system shall allow the user to enter their delivery information.
