    FR  [4.6.REQ-6] On a successful transaction the books (titles and prices and quantities) will be displayed to the screen.

[4.7] Purchase
    FR  [4.7.REQ-1] The system shall allow a registered and logged-in user to purchase books that are in their shopping cart.
    FR  [4.7.REQ-2] The system shall display total cost of the books in the shopping cart.
    FR  [4.7.REQ-3] The system shall allow the user to enter their delivery information.
    FR  [4.7.REQ-4] After a successful transaction user system shall prompt the user to enter their payment information.
    FR  [4.7.REQ-5] On a successful transaction the books (titles and prices and quantities) will be displayed to the screen.

[4.8] Print
    FR  [4.8.REQ-1] The system shall allow a registered and logged-in user to request a print from a chosen print shop.
    FR  [4.8.REQ-2] The system shall prompt the user to enter the url of the google drive link of the soft copy to be printed.
    FR  [4.8.REQ-3] The system shall display the total cost of printing the soft copy.
    FR  [4.8.REQ-4] The system shall allow the user to enter their delivery information.
    FR  [4.8.REQ-5] After a successful transaction user system shall prompt the user to enter their payment information.
    FR  [4.8.REQ-6] On a successful transaction the delivery status will the displayed.

